### 1. Creator login
# @name creatorLogin
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "creator@postflow.com",
  "password": "Demo@1234"
}

### 2. Manager login
# @name managerLogin
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "manager@postflow.com",
  "password": "Demo@1234"
}

### 3. Draft post banao (201)
# @name newPost
POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Summer sale",
  "content": "Our summer sale starts today! Up to 30% off.",
  "platforms": ["instagram", "linkedin"]
}

### 4. Bina token ke (401)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "No token",
  "content": "This should fail",
  "platforms": ["instagram"]
}

### 5. Title ke bina (400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "content": "Missing title",
  "platforms": ["instagram"]
}

### 6. Manager post nahi bana sakta (403)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{managerLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Manager post",
  "content": "Managers cannot create posts",
  "platforms": ["instagram"]
}

### 7. Creator ki posts ki list (200)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 8. Ek post ki detail (200)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/posts/{{newPost.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 9. Post edit karo (200)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/posts/{{newPost.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Summer sale (updated)",
  "content": "Our summer sale starts today! Up to 40% off.",
  "platforms": ["instagram", "linkedin", "facebook"]
}

### 10. Image upload (201)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts/{{newPost.response.body.$.id}}/media
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=PostFlowBoundary

--PostFlowBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="test.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./test.png
--PostFlowBoundary--

### 11. Manager abhi draft nahi dekh sakta (404)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/posts/{{newPost.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{managerLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 12. Approval ke liye submit (200)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts/{{newPost.response.body.$.id}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 13. Dobara submit (409)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts/{{newPost.response.body.$.id}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 14. Manager ab post dekh sakta hai (200)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{managerLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 15. Delete test ke liye ek aur draft banao (201)
# @name tempPost
POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Temporary post",
  "content": "I will delete this one",
  "platforms": ["facebook"]
}

### 16. Wo draft delete karo (200)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/posts/{{tempPost.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorLogin.response.body.$.token}}